<title>UK: UK meals and feeds firm, trade quiet.</title>
<headline>UK meals and feeds firm, trade quiet.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>High protein soymeal on the UK meals and feeds market was firm on Friday following overnight gains in Chicago, but buyers were showing no interest.</p>
<p>High pro sellers marked up prices three to one stg ex-mill and around two stg ex-store east coast.</p>
<p>&quot;It's been a very boring day with nothing doing,&quot; said one broker.</p>
<p>Rapemeal and sunflower meal were unchanged while corn gluten feed pellet sellers were one stg lower.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8062</p>
